1
00:00:00,318 --> 00:00:07,450
PAN card online apply karna hai? To chaliye, aaj Protean ki official website se, poora process step by step seekhte hain.

2
00:00:07,832 --> 00:00:12,011
Is video mein form bharna, documents, fees, aur status check karna, sab kuch bataunga.

3
00:00:12,965 --> 00:00:16,970
To sabse pehle browser mein, Protean ki ye official website kholiye.

4
00:00:17,352 --> 00:00:22,733
Yahan saaf likha hai, ki 1 April 2026 se, naye PAN ke liye naye form laagu ho gaye hain.

5
00:00:23,115 --> 00:00:27,551
Indian citizen ke liye, ab Form No. 93 istemaal hota hai.

6
00:00:27,933 --> 00:00:31,515
Aur ye form tabhi bhariye, jab aapne pehle kabhi PAN ke liye apply na kiya ho.

7
00:00:32,696 --> 00:00:35,475
Ab apply karne se pehle, documents ki list dekh lijiye.

8
00:00:35,857 --> 00:00:39,462
Yahan teen tarah ke proof chahiye, Identity, Address, aur Date of Birth.

9
00:00:39,844 --> 00:00:43,240
Ab dhyan se dekhiye, Aadhaar card Identity aur Address ke liye chalta hai.

10
00:00:43,622 --> 00:00:45,775
Lekin Date of Birth ke aage, yahan No likha hai.

11
00:00:46,157 --> 00:00:51,512
To Date of Birth ke liye, passport, driving licence, ya voter ID jaisa koi document rakhiye.

12
00:00:51,894 --> 00:00:55,138
Dasvi ki marksheet bhi, Date of Birth proof ke liye chalti hai.

13
00:00:56,320 --> 00:00:57,353
Ab fees dekh lete hain.

14
00:00:57,735 --> 00:01:03,937
Agar aap documents courier se bhejte hain, yaani physical mode, to PAN card ki fees ₹107 hai.

15
00:01:04,319 --> 00:01:08,917
Aur paperless mode, yaani e-KYC aur e-Sign mein, ye fees ₹101 hai.

16
00:01:09,299 --> 00:01:12,625
Agar aapko sirf e-PAN chahiye, to physical mode mein ₹72 lagte hain.

17
00:01:13,006 --> 00:01:15,495
Aur paperless mode mein, ye fees ₹66 hai.

18
00:01:15,876 --> 00:01:19,667
e-Sign chunne par, ₹5.90 ka charge alag se lagta hai.

19
00:01:20,849 --> 00:01:25,746
Ab Apply wale link par click karte hi, ye Online PAN Application ka page khulta hai.

20
00:01:26,128 --> 00:01:29,580
Yahan sabse pehle, PAN Application Type wale dropdown par click kijiye.

21
00:01:29,962 --> 00:01:33,304
Phir New PAN, Form No. 93, Indian Citizen chuniye.

22
00:01:33,685 --> 00:01:37,626
Ab dekhiye, Form 93 chunte hi, Applicant Category wala dropdown hat jata hai.

23
00:01:38,008 --> 00:01:41,032
Ab apna naam bhariye, First Name, Middle Name, aur Last Name.

24
00:01:42,281 --> 00:01:44,098
Upar laal rang wala note zaroor padhiye.

25
00:01:44,480 --> 00:01:48,328
Agar Aadhaar mein naam ke initials hain, to yahan poora naam likhna hai.

26
00:01:48,710 --> 00:01:53,089
Aur Aadhaar wala naam aage alag se bharna hota hai, wahi naam PAN card par chhapta hai.

27
00:01:53,471 --> 00:01:56,355
Ab Date of Birth, Email ID, aur Mobile Number daliye.

28
00:01:58,107 --> 00:02:02,910
Email aur mobile apna hi daliye, kyunki token number aur updates inhi par aate hain.

29
00:02:03,292 --> 00:02:04,915
Ab consent wale box par tick kijiye.

30
00:02:05,297 --> 00:02:07,605
Phir neeche captcha bhariye, aur Submit par click kijiye.

31
00:02:07,987 --> 00:02:12,689
Submit karte hi, ek token number banta hai, jo screen par dikhta hai, aur email par bhi aata hai.

32
00:02:13,071 --> 00:02:17,796
Is token number se, adhoora form baad mein, Resume Application se poora kar sakte hain.

33
00:02:18,796 --> 00:02:23,615
Token ke baad aage ka form khulta hai, ye steps main aasaan tareeke se samjhata hoon.

34
00:02:23,996 --> 00:02:25,812
Yahan apply karne ke chaar tareeke milte hain.

35
00:02:26,194 --> 00:02:30,315
Sabse aasaan hai e-KYC aur e-Sign, isme koi kaagaz bhejna nahi padta.

36
00:02:30,697 --> 00:02:33,710
Phir chunna hai, ki physical PAN card chahiye, ya sirf e-PAN.

37
00:02:34,092 --> 00:02:38,485
Iske baad personal details, Aadhaar wala naam, pata, aur contact details bharni hoti hain.

38
00:02:38,867 --> 00:02:41,785
Phir AO Code bharna hota hai, jo apne shehar ke hisaab se milta hai.

39
00:02:42,967 --> 00:02:46,005
AO Code, website ke is AO Codes wale page par milta hai.

40
00:02:46,386 --> 00:02:48,610
Yahan list kholkar, apne shehar ka sahi code chuniye.

41
00:02:49,610 --> 00:02:51,376
Ab form check karke, payment kijiye.

42
00:02:51,758 --> 00:02:56,777
Paperless mode mein, credit card, debit card, ya net banking se payment hota hai.

43
00:02:57,159 --> 00:03:00,561
Payment ke baad acknowledgement milta hai, jisme 15 ankon ka number hota hai.

44
00:03:00,943 --> 00:03:02,884
Iski PDF, email par bhi aati hai.

45
00:03:03,265 --> 00:03:12,524
Agar aapne physical mode chuna hai, to sign ki hui acknowledgement, photo, aur documents, 15 din ke andar, Protean ke Pune office bhejne hote hain.

46
00:03:12,905 --> 00:03:16,596
Sab sahi hone par, PAN card aam taur par kareeb do hafte mein dispatch ho jata hai.

47
00:03:17,778 --> 00:03:23,020
Ab status check karna seekhte hain, apply karne ke teen din baad, aap status track kar sakte hain.

48
00:03:23,402 --> 00:03:26,255
Yahan Application Type mein, PAN – New / Change Request chuniye.

49
00:03:26,637 --> 00:03:29,944
Phir acknowledgement number daalkar submit kijiye, aapka status dikh jayega.

50
00:03:30,944 --> 00:03:35,259
To doston, is tarah aap Protean ki website se, naya PAN card online apply kar sakte hain.

51
00:03:35,641 --> 00:03:38,082
Poori checklist, description mein di hai.

52
00:03:38,464 --> 00:03:44,587
Video achha laga ho, to like aur share kijiye, aur Learn Vexa channel ko subscribe kijiye. Thank you!

